# Charis — the aphrOS motion and material library.
#
# Named for the Greek personification of grace, which is the whole brief: the
# difference between a UI that moves and a UI that moves WELL. Sits under
# Quickshell rather than replacing it — Quickshell supplies the Wayland
# surfaces and the system services, this supplies what they should look and
# feel like.
#
# ⚠️ NOTHING HERE MAY DEPEND ON QUICKSHELL OR ON APHROS. Every type below is
# plain Qt Quick, so the library drops into any Qt 6.11 application — a
# Quickshell bar, a KDE plasmoid, a normal desktop app. That constraint is the
# reason this is a separate module instead of files inside the shell, and it
# is worth defending on every addition: the moment one type imports Quickshell,
# the library stops being usable by anyone who is not writing a Wayland shell.

module Charis

Spring 1.0 Spring.qml
Squircle 1.0 Squircle.qml
MagnifiedRow 1.0 MagnifiedRow.qml
Glass 1.0 Glass.qml
Hop 1.0 Hop.qml
CrtOff 1.0 CrtOff.qml
PixelBurst 1.0 PixelBurst.qml

singleton FrameBudget 1.0 FrameBudget.qml
singleton Ticker 1.0 Ticker.qml
